        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Little Nightmares is a puzzle-platform horror adventure game developed by Tarsier Studios and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Set in a mysterious world, Little Nightmares follows the journey of Six, a hungry little girl who must escape the Maw, an iron vessel inhabited by monstrous, twisted beings.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Little Nightmares es un juego de aventura de terror, con puzles y plataformas, desarrollado por Tarsier Studios y publicado por Bandai Namco Entertainment. Ambientado en un mundo misterioso, Little Nightmares sigue el viaje de Six, una niña hambrienta que debe escapar de the Maw, un buque de hierro habitado por seres monstruosos y retorcidos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
